<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Bundesliga after Saturday's games:</p>
<p>11 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>10 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>9 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Ulf Kirsten (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Giovane Elber (VfB</p>
<p>Stuttgart)</p>
